# --- discern harness ---
# Compiled agent files are generated by `discern refresh` from discern's
# built-in guidance + your [guidance].sources. AGENTS.md is intentionally left
# tracked so guidance changes show up in diffs and review; the other provider
# mirrors are regenerated artifacts and are not committed.
/CLAUDE.md
/GEMINI.md
# Everything under .claude/ is generated or ephemeral — the materialized skills
# (.claude/skills/, copied/symlinked by `discern refresh`) and the linked
# worktree checkouts created by the worktree hooks — EXCEPT your settings, which
# are tracked. (Leaving the worktree checkouts tracked would make the main
# checkout read "dirty" the moment a worktree is created, blocking graduation.)
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/settings.local.json
# NOTE: `.mcp.json` (the project-scoped MCP servers `discern refresh` wires
# `discern mcp` into) is deliberately NOT listed here. It is shared, co-owned
# config that discern MERGES into (preserving your own servers) — like
# .claude/settings.json, not a wholesale-regenerated derivative like CLAUDE.md —
# so the team gets the server. Leave it tracked; never add it to this fragment.
